Package: opennovella
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pygame (>= 2.1), python3-pil, python3-tk
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Shawn Rapaz <shawnrapaz@gmail.com>
Description: easy visual novel engine with a visual editor
 OpenNovella lets anyone create visual novels with branching paths,
 characters, backgrounds, music, transitions and animations using a
 point-and-click editor - no programming needed.
 .
 Features include choices and variables for branching stories, a story
 map, a story checker, animated GIF/WebP and frame-folder animations,
 save/load with thumbnails, history, auto and skip modes, and exporting
 games to share.
 .
 Created by Shawn Rapaz and Claude Code.
